00:00.000  apparatus │   ~ Everything a new player does before they meet anything dangerous: arrive, read the room, walk
                      somewhere, come back, and find out who else is around.
                      
                      This plan needs no content at all, which is what makes it the one to run first against a server
                      you have never pointed the apparatus at. If it reads oddly, the problem is the apparatus or the
                      connection, not the world.
