00:03.185  Theron   │ Commands
                        n / e / s / w / u / d - move between rooms
                        look (l) - describe the room again
                        say <message> - speak to everyone in the room
                        who - list everyone online
                        inventory (i) - list what you're carrying
                        examine <item> (ex) - look closely at an item
                        get <item> - pick up an item from the ground
                        drop <item> - put down an item from your inventory
                        destroy <item> - permanently destroy an item you're carrying
                        wear <item> - equip an item on your body
                        wield <item> - equip an item in your hand
                        remove <item> (re) - unequip an item
                        give <item> <character> - give an item to someone
                        emote <message> - express an emotion or action
                        help - this list
                        stats - show your damage, armor, and combat stats
                        quit - save and leave the world
                        attack <target> (att) - attack target
                        assist <player> (as) - attack whatever they are attacking
                        consider <target> (con) - estimate target strength
                        flee (f) - attempt to escape combat
                        bind (b) - set respawn point in this room
                        sleep (sl) - rest deeply and regenerate quickly
                        rest (r) - sit and recover
                        stand (st) - wake up and be ready
                        cast <ability> [target] (ca) - cast an ability
                        abilities (ab) - list your known abilities
                        talk <npc> (t) - speak with an NPC about quests
                        quest [name] - your journal, or one quest in detail
                        quests - list your active quests
                        abandon <name> - give up an active quest
                        group [invite|accept|decline|leave|kick|disband] <who> (gr) - adventure together
                        gtell <message> (gt) - speak to your group, wherever they are
                        autofollow <player> (auto) - walk behind someone in your group
                        tell <who> <message> (te) - speak privately, anywhere in the world
                        reply <message> - answer the last person who told you something
                        chat <message> | chat on|off (ch) - the world channel
                        recall (rec) - return to where you bound your soul
                        list - see what a shopkeeper has
                        buy <item> - purchase an item from a shopkeeper
                        sell <item> - sell an item to a shopkeeper
                        buffs - list your active effects
                      
                      Most verbs accept a prefix, so 'l' is 'look'.
                      No space needed after ' or " = say, ; or : = emote.
